## Claude Code (~/.claude/ -> src/.claude/)
## Strategy: Ignore runtime data, track configs
##
## src/.claude/to_claude/ is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for:
##   - agents/     (agent definitions)
##   - bin/        (utility scripts)
##   - commands/   (custom slash commands)
##   - examples/   (example configs)
##   - guidelines/ (coding guidelines)
##   - hooks/      (pre/post hooks)
##   - skills/     (skill definitions)
##   - templates/  (project templates)

# Ignore runtime/sensitive data in src/.claude/
src/.claude/.credentials*.json
src/.claude/.gitmodules
src/.claude/bin/
src/.claude/cache/
src/.claude/.claude/
src/.claude/debug/
src/.claude/file-history/
src/.claude/history.jsonl
src/.claude/logs/
src/.claude/mcp.json
src/.claude/paste-cache/
src/.claude/plans/
src/.claude/plugins/
src/.claude/projects/
src/.claude/session-env/
src/.claude/settings.json
src/.claude/shell-snapshots/
src/.claude/stats-cache.json
src/.claude/statsig/
src/.claude/tasks/
src/.claude/telemetry/
src/.claude/todos/
src/.claude/to_user/

# TRACK: to_claude/ as single source of truth (all subdirs)
# Except nested .claude/ and docs/to_claude/ dirs (auto-generated)
src/.claude/to_claude/**/.claude/
src/.claude/to_claude/**/docs/to_claude/

# TRACK: Root-level docs and configs
# (agents, commands, hooks, skills are symlinks to to_claude/)

# Project-specific .claude dirs (auto-generated, ignore everywhere)
src/.bash.d/.claude/
src/.bin/.claude/
src/.emacs.d/.claude/
src/.emacs.d/**/.claude/
**/.claude/projects/
**/.claude/session-env/
**/.claude/file-history/
**/.claude/debug/
**/.claude/cache/
**/.claude/shell-snapshots/


